From: Harvi654 <202698022+Harvi654@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msi: Respect required DisallowAdvertise state timing.

AI-assisted (Codex), original code; LGPL-2.1-or-later. Not submitted
upstream.

Windows v14 attr26 accepts API Advertised before costing, which later resets
it. Post-cost already Local attr26 stays Local on Advertised. Attr18 remains
Advertised. Restrict the new coercion to the measured attr26 combination;
other attributes and maintenance retain their existing behavior. Shared
v14 pre-cost/post-seed assertions; RULE_API. No property Advertise26 coercion.

--- a/dlls/msi/install.c
+++ b/dlls/msi/install.c
@@ -1026,11 +1026,21 @@
 
     if (!msi_get_property_int( package->db, L"Installed", 0 ))
     {
+        BOOL after_cost = msi_get_property_int( package->db, L"CostingComplete", 0 );
         BOOL required = feature->Attributes == (msidbFeatureAttributesFollowParent |
             msidbFeatureAttributesDisallowAdvertise | msidbFeatureAttributesUIDisallowAbsent);
 
-        if (iState == INSTALLSTATE_SOURCE && required)
+        if ((iState == INSTALLSTATE_SOURCE && required) ||
+            (after_cost && iState == INSTALLSTATE_ADVERTISED && required &&
+             feature->ActionRequest == INSTALLSTATE_LOCAL))
             iState = INSTALLSTATE_LOCAL;
+        /* Pre-cost API advertising is accepted; CostFinalize later resets it. */
+        if (!after_cost && iState == INSTALLSTATE_ADVERTISED && required)
+        {
+            feature->ActionRequest = iState;
+            ACTION_UpdateComponentStates( package, feature );
+            return ERROR_SUCCESS;
+        }
     }
 
     if (iState == INSTALLSTATE_LOCAL && msi_get_property_int( package->db, L"CostingComplete", 0 ) &&
